<title>USA: Information Storage stake held by firm.</title>
<headline>Information Storage stake held by firm.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fred Kolber and Co, a Chicago-based broker-dealer, said Monday it holds a 5.6 percent stake or 536,407 common shares in Information Storage Devices Inc.</p>
<p>In a filng with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Kolber said it paid $3.3 million for the stake or an average of $6.25 a share, including 467,405 shares it bought between October 10 and November 21.</p>
<p>The firm said it acquired the stake in the normal course of its brokerage business.</p>
</text>
